  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve Menstrual Hygiene of 3000 IDPs in Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will improve the Health &amp; Menstrual Hygiene of women/girls by providing, a pad &amp; a pant to 3000 vulnerable &amp; traumatize IDPs in  Kosala- Cameroon. This will reduce the rate of inffections related to poor menstral hygiene. Targeting 40 villages with no access to medical facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
